---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import QuoteForm from '../../../../components/QuoteForm.astro';
import '../../../../styles/detail.css';

const title = '钢梁与钢柱按图加工 | 定制钢结构构件 | 中赛钢构';
const description = '中赛钢构根据项目图纸、深化图和技术要求加工钢梁与钢柱，包括H型钢构件、焊接钢梁、钢柱及定制异形构件，支持构件标识、包装装柜与出口交付。';
const lang = 'zh';
const canonical = 'https://zhongsai-steelstructure.com/zh/components/fabricated-steel-beams-columns/';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} lang={lang}>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="detail-hero">
    <div class="detail-hero-bg" style="background-image: url('/images/components/steel-members-beams-columns.jpg');"></div>
    <div class="detail-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="detail-hero-content">
      <span class="eyebrow">钢梁 · 钢柱 · 按图加工</span>
      <h1>按项目图纸加工的钢梁与钢柱</h1>
      <p class="lead">中赛钢构根据项目结构图纸、深化图和技术规格书，加工H型钢构件、焊接钢梁、钢柱及定制异形钢构件。具体材料、尺寸、焊接要求和表面处理按项目图纸与技术要求确定，支持构件标识、包装装柜与出口交付。</p>
      <div class="detail-hero-actions">
        <a href="#quote" class="btn btn-primary">提交图纸获取报价</a>
        <a href="/zh/manufacturing-quality/" class="btn btn-outline">查看制造能力</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <nav class="detail-breadcrumb">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="/zh/">首页</a>
      <span class="sep">/</span>
      <a href="/zh/components/">构件与材料</a>
      <span class="sep">/</span>
      <span class="current">钢梁与钢柱</span>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- 01 Fabricated Beams & Columns -->
  <section class="detail-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <p class="section-index">01 / 可加工构件</p>
        <h2>中赛钢构可以加工哪些钢梁与钢柱</h2>
        <p>根据项目图纸和技术要求，中赛钢构可加工以下类型钢梁与钢柱构件。具体加工范围和技术要求按项目图纸确认。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="requirement-grid">
        <div class="requirement-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="req-icon">📐</div>
          <h3>H型钢构件</h3>
          <p>H型钢梁、H型钢柱，按图纸尺寸和焊接要求加工。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="requirement-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="req-icon">🔗</div>
          <h3>焊接钢梁</h3>
          <p>组合截面焊接梁、箱型梁等，按节点图和焊接要求加工。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="requirement-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="req-icon">🏛️</div>
          <h3>钢柱</h3>
          <p>H型钢柱、箱型柱、格构柱等，按项目结构图纸加工。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="requirement-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="req-icon">🧱</div>
          <h3>定制异形构件</h3>
          <p>设备平台构件、支撑、节点板及定制异形钢构件。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="requirement-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="req-icon">⚙️</div>
          <h3>吊车梁</h3>
          <p>按吊车系统及结构要求进行吊车梁构件加工。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="requirement-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="req-icon">📦</div>
          <h3>配套连接件</h3>
          <p>节点板、连接板、加劲板等配套构件，可随主体结构一并供应。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 02 Fabrication to Project Drawings -->
  <section class="detail-section alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <p class="section-index">02 / 按图加工</p>
        <h2>根据项目图纸进行钢梁钢柱加工</h2>
        <p>中赛钢构根据客户提供的结构图纸、深化图（Shop Drawings）和技术规格书组织钢梁钢柱加工。具体材料牌号、焊接工艺、检验要求和表面处理按项目图纸与技术要求确定。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="image-text-block">
        <div class="itb-image">
          <img src="/images/components/steel-members-complex-fabricated-components.jpg" alt="中赛钢构钢梁钢柱按图加工制造" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <div class="itb-content">
          <h3>从图纸到成品构件</h3>
          <p>中赛钢构拥有自有生产基地，可根据项目图纸进行钢梁、钢柱及定制构件的加工制造。</p>
          <ul>
            <li>根据结构图纸和深化图组织加工</li>
            <li>按项目技术规格书控制制造要求</li>
            <li>可配合BOQ进行构件清单核对与报价</li>
            <li>具体材料、尺寸、焊接要求按项目约定执行</li>
            <li>表面处理按项目要求安排，具体方式和规格以技术要求为准</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 03 Typical Project Applications -->
  <section class="detail-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <p class="section-index">03 / 典型应用</p>
        <h2>钢梁钢柱的典型项目应用</h2>
        <p>加工好的钢梁钢柱构件可用于以下类型钢结构项目。具体应用范围按项目图纸和技术要求确定。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <div class="feature-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="feature-img" style="background-image: url('/images/products/01-industrial.jpg');"></div>
          <div class="feature-body">
            <h3>工业厂房与生产车间</h3>
            <p>用于钢结构工业厂房的主体框架、吊车梁及支撑系统。</p>
            <a href="/zh/steel-workshop/" class="feature-link">查看工业厂房 →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="feature-img" style="background-image: url('/images/products/04-warehouse-logistics.jpg');"></div>
          <div class="feature-body">
            <h3>仓库与物流建筑</h3>
            <p>用于钢结构仓库和物流建筑的主体框架与支撑系统。</p>
            <a href="/zh/steel-warehouse/" class="feature-link">查看仓库方案 →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="feature-img" style="background-image: url('/images/components/steel-members-heavy-box-columns-trusses.jpg');"></div>
          <div class="feature-body">
            <h3>设备平台与定制结构</h3>
            <p>用于工业设备平台、操作平台及定制异形钢结构构件。</p>
            <a href="/zh/products/custom-engineering/" class="feature-link">查看定制工程 →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="feature-img" style="background-image: url('/images/products/03-commercial-public.jpg');"></div>
          <div class="feature-body">
            <h3>商业与工业建筑</h3>
            <p>用于商业建筑、展厅及其他工业钢结构项目的主体框架。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 04 From Drawing to Fabricated Member -->
  <section class="detail-section alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <p class="section-index">04 / 加工流程</p>
        <h2>从图纸到成品构件的加工流程</h2>
        <p>以下为钢梁钢柱按图加工的简要流程。详细制造过程、质量控制和8步制造流程请查看制造能力页面。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-flow">
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="step-num">01</div>
          <h4>图纸审核</h4>
          <p>结构图纸与加工可行性审核</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="step-num">02</div>
          <h4>深化协调</h4>
          <p>深化图与加工图协调确认</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="step-num">03</div>
          <h4>制造加工</h4>
          <p>切割、组立、焊接、矫正、钻孔</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-4">
          <div class="step-num">04</div>
          <h4>表面处理</h4>
          <p>按项目要求安排抛丸与涂层</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="step-num">05</div>
          <h4>标识包装</h4>
          <p>构件标识、编号与包装装柜</p>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="step-num">06</div>
          <h4>出口准备</h4>
          <p>出口单证支持与物流协调</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top: 24px;">
        <a href="/zh/manufacturing-quality/" class="btn btn-outline">查看详细8步制造流程</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 05 What We Need for Quotation -->
  <section class="detail-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <p class="section-index">05 / 报价资料</p>
        <h2>获取钢梁钢柱报价需要提供什么资料</h2>
        <p>提供越完整的图纸和技术资料，评估和报价越准确。资料不完整时可先提交现有资料，中赛钢构将进一步确认制造与报价所需信息。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="quote-info-grid">
        <div class="quote-info-card drawing">
          <h4>📋 已有完整图纸</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>项目所在国家</li>
            <li>结构图纸（建筑/结构）</li>
            <li>深化图 / Shop Drawings（如有）</li>
            <li>工程量清单（BOQ）（如有）</li>
            <li>项目技术规格书</li>
            <li>所需数量 / 供应范围</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="quote-info-card no-drawing">
          <h4>📝 资料不完整</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>项目所在国家</li>
            <li>现有图纸或草图</li>
            <li>构件类型与大致数量</li>
            <li>项目用途与基本尺寸</li>
            <li>已知技术要求</li>
            <li>可先提交现有资料进行初步评估</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="quote-note">* 客户可先提交PDF图纸、BOQ或现有项目资料进行初步审核。最终加工范围和报价确认前，可能还需要补充相关图纸、技术规格或项目要求。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 06 Related Capabilities -->
  <section class="detail-section alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal">
        <p class="section-index">06 / 相关能力</p>
        <h2>相关能力与页面</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="related-links">
        <a href="/zh/components/" class="related-link-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="rl-icon">🧱</div>
          <h4>构件与材料</h4>
          <p>钢梁、钢柱、桁架、檩条及围护系统</p>
          <span class="rl-arrow">查看详情 →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/products/custom-engineering/" class="related-link-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="rl-icon">⚙️</div>
          <h4>定制工程与按图加工</h4>
          <p>海外项目钢结构按图加工与定制制造</p>
          <span class="rl-arrow">查看详情 →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/manufacturing-quality/" class="related-link-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="rl-icon">🏭</div>
          <h4>制造与质量控制</h4>
          <p>8步制造流程、质量控制与包装出口</p>
          <span class="rl-arrow">查看详情 →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/steel-workshop/" class="related-link-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="rl-icon">🏗️</div>
          <h4>工业厂房与车间</h4>
          <p>钢结构工业厂房解决方案</p>
          <span class="rl-arrow">查看详情 →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/steel-warehouse/" class="related-link-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
          <div class="rl-icon">📦</div>
          <h4>钢结构仓库</h4>
          <p>钢结构仓库与物流建筑解决方案</p>
          <span class="rl-arrow">查看详情 →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/zh/components/roof-wall-cladding-systems/" class="related-link-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="rl-icon">🏠</div>
          <h4>屋面墙面围护系统</h4>
          <p>屋面板、墙面板及配套围护材料</p>
          <span class="rl-arrow">查看详情 →</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 07 FAQ -->
  <section class="detail-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal" style="text-align: center;">
        <p class="section-index" style="justify-content: center;">07 / 常见问题</p>
        <h2>钢梁钢柱加工常见问题</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="detail-faq">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>中赛钢构可以根据客户提供的图纸加工钢梁和钢柱吗？</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">
              可以。中赛钢构根据客户提供的结构图纸、深化图和技术规格书组织钢梁、钢柱及定制构件加工。具体材料、尺寸、焊接要求和表面处理按项目图纸与技术要求确定。图纸审核通过后可安排制造。
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>获取钢梁钢柱报价需要提供哪些图纸？</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">
              理想情况下需要提供结构图纸、深化图（Shop Drawings）、工程量清单（BOQ）、项目技术规格书和项目所在国家。资料不完整时可先提交现有资料，中赛钢构将进一步确认制造与报价所需信息。客户可先提交PDF图纸、BOQ或现有项目资料进行初步审核。
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>可以加工定制异形钢构件吗？</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">
              可以。中赛钢构可根据项目图纸加工定制异形钢构件，包括设备平台构件、支撑、节点板及其他非标准构件。具体加工范围和技术要求按项目图纸确认。
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
            <span>加工好的钢梁钢柱可以包装并准备出口吗？</span>
            <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">
              可以。构件可根据深化图和项目要求进行标识与编号，按构件类型、装柜顺序和出口运输要求组织包装，支持集装箱装柜。中赛钢构提供出口单证支持和物流协调，但不作为报关行或货运代理。当地施工和安装由客户或当地施工团队完成。
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 08 Quote CTA + QuoteForm -->
  <section class="detail-section dark" id="quote">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal" style="text-align: center;">
        <p class="section-index" style="justify-content: center; color: #f59e0b;">08 / 获取报价</p>
        <h2 style="color: #fff;">有图纸或BOQ？提交项目资料获取报价</h2>
        <p style="margin: 0 auto; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">提交项目图纸、BOQ和技术要求，中赛钢构将进行初步评估并确认报价所需信息。</p>
      </div>
      <QuoteForm lang="zh" />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  // FAQ toggle
  document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question').forEach(btn => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const item = btn.closest('.faq-item');
      const isOpen = item.classList.contains('open');
      item.classList.toggle('open');
      btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', !isOpen);
    });
  });

  // Scroll reveal
  const revealElements = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
  if ('IntersectionObserver' in window) {
    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
      entries.forEach(entry => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          entry.target.style.opacity = '1';
          entry.target.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';
          observer.unobserve(entry.target);
        }
      });
    }, { threshold: 0.1 });
    revealElements.forEach(el => {
      el.style.opacity = '0';
      el.style.transform = 'translateY(24px)';
      el.style.transition = 'opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease';
      observer.observe(el);
    });
  }
</script>
